   "bank": "0.1",
   "jp": "{1c:13}{0b:08}{e080} アレクシス=デューラー {e081}{0b:09}\nくぅぅぅぅ・・・{1a}貴様、このわしを赤獅子{e084}士団副将\nアレクシス=デューラーと\n知っての狼藉か!?{0c:2b5309fe}",
   "read": "{1c:13}{0b:08}【 アレクシス=デューラー 】{0b:09}\nくぅぅぅぅ・・・{1a}貴様、このわしを赤獅子騎士団副将\nアレクシス=デューラーと\n知っての狼藉か!?{0c:2b5309fe}",
   "raw": null,
   "en": "{1c:13}{0b:08}【 Alexis Durer 】{0b:09}\nNnngh...{1a}You dare this outrage, knowing full well\nthat I am Alexis Durer, vice-commander\nof the Red Lion Knights!?{0c:2b5309fe}",
   "status": "done",
   "tl": "Nnngh... // You dare this outrage, knowing full well that I am Alexis Durer, vice-commander of the Red Lion Knights!?"
  },
  {
