   "bank": "0.1",
   "jp": "{1c:10}{0b:08}{e080} 不死者ファトゥム {e081}{0b:09}\n知っている。\nその顔は忘れもしない。\n醜く{e08b}老いても一目で分かったよ。{0c:2b5409fe}",
   "read": "{1c:10}{0b:08}【 不死者ファトゥム 】{0b:09}\n知っている。\nその顔は忘れもしない。\n醜く年老いても一目で分かったよ。{0c:2b5409fe}",
   "raw": null,
   "en": "{1c:10}{0b:08}【 Fatum the Undying 】{0b:09}\nI do. I could never forget that face. Even\ngrown ugly and old, I knew it at a glance.{0c:2b5409fe}",
   "status": "done",
   "tl": "I do. I could never forget that face. Even grown ugly and old, I knew it at a glance."
  },
